# Phase 1 Aesthetic Improvements - Master Rule

**Status**: ACTIVE (January 2025)
**Version**: 1.0
**Priority**: CRITICAL

## Overview

This rule enforces the Phase 1 aesthetic improvements that establish the Service Design Leader brand identity. All development must follow these standards.

## Quick Reference

### 🎨 Color Palette: Service Design Leader

**MANDATORY COLOR USAGE**:

- **Primary (Deep Navy #0F2851)**: 60% - Headings, navigation, primary actions
- **Secondary (Warm Rust #D97706)**: 30% - CTAs, links, warm accents
- **Accent (Sage Green #059669)**: 10% - Success, highlights, growth

**Rule**: NEVER use hardcoded colors. ALWAYS use `var(--color-*)` tokens.

### ✍️ Content Voice

**MANDATORY VOICE**:

- **First-person professional** ("I help..." NOT "Dale helps...")
- **Active voice** (80%+ of sentences)
- **Australian English** (organise, colour, centre)
- **Confident without arrogance**
- **Practical over academic**

### 🎬 Animation System

**MANDATORY ANIMATIONS**:

- Use unified animation system (`src/styles/animations.css`)
- NEVER duplicate keyframes
- ALWAYS respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
- Use utility classes: `.animate-fade-in-up`, `.hover-lift`, etc.

### 🚫 Inline Styles

**FORBIDDEN**: Never use `style` attributes in components.
**REQUIRED**: Always use CSS classes in dedicated component stylesheets.

## Implementation Rules

### Rule 1: No Hardcoded Colors

❌ **VIOLATION**:

```css
.my-component {
  color: #ffffff;
  background: #0f2851;
}
```

```astro
<div style="color: var(--color-text-primary);"></div>
```

✅ **CORRECT**:

```css
.my-component {
  color: var(--color-primary-contrast);
  background: var(--color-primary-main);
}
```

```astro
<div class="my-component"></div>
```

### Rule 2: Use Unified Animation System

❌ **VIOLATION**:

```css
@keyframes fadeInUp {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}
```

✅ **CORRECT**:

```html
<div class="animate-fade-in-up">Content</div>
```

```css
.my-component {
  animation: fadeInUp 600ms cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1) forwards;
}
```

### Rule 3: First-Person Content Voice

❌ **VIOLATION**:

```markdown
Dale Rogers is a service designer who specializes in behavior change.
```

✅ **CORRECT**:

```markdown
I'm a service designer who specialises in behaviour change.
```

### Rule 4: Component Stylesheet Pattern

❌ **VIOLATION**:

```astro
---
// Component without stylesheet
---

<div style="padding: 20px;">
  <h2 style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Title</h2>
</div>
```

✅ **CORRECT**:

```astro
---
import '@/styles/components/my-component.css';
---

<div class="my-component">
  <h2 class="my-component__title">Title</h2>
</div>
```

```css
/* src/styles/components/my-component.css */
.my-component {
  @apply p-5;
}

.my-component__title {
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
}

:root[data-theme='dark'] .my-component__title {
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
}
```

