## Pre-Commit Checklist

Before committing ANY changes:

### Colors & Styling

- [ ] No hardcoded colors (search for `#` in CSS files)
- [ ] All colors use `var(--color-*)` tokens
- [ ] No inline `style` attributes in components
- [ ] Component has dedicated stylesheet in `src/styles/components/`
- [ ] Dark mode styles included

### Animations

- [ ] No duplicate keyframe definitions
- [ ] Using unified animation system
- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` respected

### Content

- [ ] First-person voice ("I" not "Dale")
- [ ] Active voice (80%+)
- [ ] Australian English spelling
- [ ] No buzzwords or unnecessary jargon

### General

- [ ] TypeScript types updated
- [ ] Documentation updated
- [ ] Tests pass
- [ ] Linter errors fixed

## Auto-Verification

Run these checks before committing:

```bash
# Check for hardcoded colors in CSS
grep -r "#[0-9A-F]\{6\}" src/styles/components/ --color=always

# Check for inline styles in components
grep -r 'style=' src/components/ --color=always

# Check for third-person references
grep -r "Dale Rogers" src/content/ --color=always

# Check for American English
grep -r "ize\|ization\|behavior\|color[^-]" src/content/ --color=always
```

## Common Violations & Fixes

### Violation: Hardcoded Color

```css
/* BEFORE */
.footer-heading {
  color: #ffffff;
}

/* AFTER */
.footer-heading {
  color: var(--color-primary-contrast);
}
```

### Violation: Inline Style

```astro
<!-- BEFORE -->
<Heading style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">
  <!-- AFTER -->
  <Heading class="hero-headline" /></Heading
>
```

```css
/* Add to component CSS */
.hero-headline {
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
}
```

### Violation: Third-Person Content

```markdown
<!-- BEFORE -->

Dale Rogers works with organisations to transform their services.

<!-- AFTER -->

I work with organisations to transform their services.
```

### Violation: Duplicate Animation

```css
/* BEFORE */
@keyframes fadeInUp { /* ... */ }
.my-component { animation: fadeInUp 0.6s; }

/* AFTER */
/* Remove @keyframes, use utility class */
<div class="animate-fade-in-up">
```

